Third-party components

The license above covers the MACDART port itself: the build scripts, the CMake
build, the test harness, and patches/macdart-port.patch. This repository does
not vendor the Dart sources; they are fetched and extracted at build time (see
macdart/port/extract.sh). The extracted and linked code is under its own,
separate BSD-3-Clause licenses:

  * The Dart VM and core libraries — Copyright 2012, the Dart project authors —
    together with Dart's additional patent grant. extract.sh preserves the full
    texts as macdart/LICENSE.dart and macdart/PATENTS.dart.

  * double-conversion — Copyright 2006-2011, the V8 project authors — under its
    own BSD-3-Clause license, retained in its source directory.

See README.md for details on what is and is not included.
